  "description": "YORLOI crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C81 H109 Dy6 N22 O38 1+,C44 H48 Dy1 N12 O12 1-. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.587-4.529 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.05-129.19°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6(LH2)3(LH)3(OH)2(CO3)3(H2O)5(dmf)4][(LH2)4Dy]·6.5dmf·3.5H2O (LH3 = 2-hydroxy-N-[3-(hydroxyimino)butan-2-ylidene]benzohydrazide; crystal analysis C125H157Dy7N34O50). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 5 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 5 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 3 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
  "interpretation_limit": "Oxidation states, nuclearity, oxo/hydroxo bridging, core charge and ligand identities/counts require article/SI or manual verification; atom-site counts are asymmetric-unit counts, not molecular stoichiometry. Graph topology is limited to identity-symmetry bonds in the CIF table. Approximate shape is based only on bridge-unwrapped metal-site coordinates in the largest component; symmetry-related bonds or periodic structures require manual crystallographic review. Empirical formulas alone do not establish unique oxidation-state assignments or ligand connectivity; annotations above reproduce explicit structural notation only.",
